{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22272","headline":"初领郡政衙退登东楼作 · 白居易","name":"初领郡政衙退登东楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鳏惸心所念，简牍手自操。\n何言符竹贵，未免州县劳。\n赖是余杭郡，台榭绕官曹。\n凌晨亲政事，向晚恣游遨。\n山冷微有雪，波平未生涛。\n水心如镜面，千里无纤毫。\n直下江最阔，近东楼更高。\n烦襟与滞念，一望皆遁逃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}